1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:03,000
That pinging sound when you
accelerate isn't nothing.

2
00:00:03,000 --> 00:00:08,000
A knock or ping under load can
point to three different things.

3
00:00:08,000 --> 00:00:13,000
Carbon buildup in the cylinders.
Low-octane fuel. Or a failing knock sensor.

4
00:00:13,000 --> 00:00:18,000
One clue: does it only happen climbing
hills or towing? Worth checking first.

5
00:00:18,000 --> 00:00:23,000
Ignoring it can let engine damage
build quietly. Don't guess which one it is.

6
00:00:23,000 --> 00:00:27,000
Stop by and we'll take a look before
it gets expensive. Nick's Tire & Auto.
